# Project Planning Phase

## Project Title
Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value

## Project Objective
To develop a ServiceNow access control mechanism that restricts record access based on a specified field value using a Script-Controlled ACL.

## Project Tasks
- Identify the required ServiceNow table and field.
- Define the access conditions.
- Create the Script-Controlled ACL.
- Develop the ACL script.
- Configure and test the access conditions.
- Verify authorized and unauthorized access.
- Document the implementation and results.

## Project Plan
1. Requirement Analysis
2. Project Design
3. ServiceNow Configuration
4. ACL Script Implementation
5. Testing and Validation
6. Documentation
7. Final Review

## Tools and Technologies
- ServiceNow
- Access Control List (ACL)
- Server-side JavaScript
- GitHub

## Expected Outcome
The project will provide a field-based record access control mechanism in ServiceNow, allowing authorized users to access records while restricting unauthorized users.

## Deliverables
- Requirement Analysis
- Project Design
- ACL Configuration
- ACL Script
- Testing Results
- Project Documentation
